Depends: linux-image-@KVER@ (= @KVERSION@), raspi-firmware, kmod, udev, python3
Description: CardputerZero drivers for the pinned kernel
 The M5Stack CardputerZero drivers (keyboard, audio codec, IO expander, fuel
 gauge, IMU) from m5stack-linux-dtoverlays @M5COMMIT@, and Gh0st OS's panel
 driver with scan sync and power switch driver, built for @KVER@. Also the device
 tree overlays, udev rules, firmware files and the fb_load boot logo.
